    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be a differentiable function satisfying <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math> is equal to",
